  "description": "Expose opted-in CQRS Commands and Queries as Model Context Protocol (MCP) tools over the Streamable HTTP transport, dispatched in-process over MediatR's IMediator. Reuses the tool set built by AddAgentFramework(); tool calls run through the same validation/logging/cache/lock/enricher pipeline as MapCommand/MapQuery. Call MapMcp() to serve the tools; the endpoint coexists with MapCommand/MapQuery/MapAgent.\nCommonly used types:\nCnblogs.Architecture.Ddd.Cqrs.Mcp.CqrsMcpOptions\nCnblogs.Architecture.Ddd.Cqrs.Mcp.CqrsInjectorExtensions\nCnblogs.Architecture.Ddd.Cqrs.Mcp.CqrsMcpServerBuilderExtensions",
